CM_ BO_ 1040 "General status message (outbound message) for all 4 inverters";
CM_ SG_ 1040 AdditionalTemperatureChannel4 "Temperature is calculated for PT1000.";
CM_ SG_ 1040 AdditionalTemperatureChannel3 "Temperature is calculated for PT1000.";
CM_ SG_ 1040 AdditionalTemperatureChannel2 "Temperature is calculated for PT1000.";
CM_ SG_ 1040 AdditionalTemperatureChannel1 "Temperature is calculated for PT1000.";
CM_ SG_ 1040 AdditionalTemperatureChannel0 "Temperature is calculated for PT1000.";
CM_ BO_ 1025 "Message for errorbits of all 4 inverters
After an error, the errorbits are latched until the respective AckErr-signal is sent (reset on rising edge).
All errorbits of the respective inverter (including general errors for all 4 or 2 inverters) are reset.";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFL_Timeout_Comm "Latched Error [1 = No new setpoint message for inverter 4 was received for more than 50 ms, 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFL_Sum_Phase_Currents "Latched Error [1 = The sum of the phase currents of inverter 4 was greater than 20A (there may be an insulation fault in the motor, a measurement error due to very strong EMI, or a wiring problem for parallel inverter operation), 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFL_Short_Circuit "Latched Error [1 =The desat (hardware overcurrent) protection of atleast one power switch of inverter 4 triggered (this could be due to a short circuit between two phases.), 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFL_Position_Sensor "Latched Error [1 = No valid position data for inverter 4 was received for more than 350  s (The communication may be disturbed by noise, or the sensor itself or the interface board may be defective), 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFL_Overtemperature "Latched Error [1 = Inverter 4 was deactivated because either the motor or the power switches got overheated, 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFL_Overspeed "Latched Error [1 = The configured speed limit (in the config) has been exceeded by motor 4, 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFL_Overcurrent "Latched Error [1 = An overcurrent in atleast one phase of inverter 4 was detected (more than 120A (175A for HV-Board_P1)), 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFL_Motortemperature "Latched Error [1 = Motor temperature measurement of inverter 4 did not work for more than 500 ms, 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFL_Internal_Fault "Latched Error [1 = Internal fault inverter 4, see Error.txt for more information (possible causes: measurement of phase currents, DC voltage, power switches temperature or gate driver supply (could also be triggered by insufficient supply)), 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFL_Disable_Under_Load "Latched Error [1 = The received enable signal of inverter 4 became low while motor was under load, 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFL_ControlError "Latched Error [1 = The current controllers of inverter 4 were unable to achieve the setpoint currents (the reference point calibration is probably incorrect or the set voltage reserve may be too low), 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFR_Timeout_Comm "Latched Error [1 = No new setpoint message for inverter 3 was received for more than 50 ms, 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFR_Sum_Phase_Currents "Latched Error [1 = The sum of the phase currents of inverter 3 was greater than 20A (there may be an insulation fault in the motor, a measurement error due to very strong EMI, or a wiring problem for parallel inverter operation), 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFR_Short_Circuit "Latched Error [1 =The desat (hardware overcurrent) protection of atleast one power switch of inverter 3 triggered (this could be due to a short circuit between two phases.), 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFR_Position_Sensor "Latched Error [1 = No valid position data for inverter 3 was received for more than 350  s (The communication may be disturbed by noise, or the sensor itself or the interface board may be defective), 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFR_Overtemperature "Latched Error [1 = Inverter 3 was deactivated because either the motor or the power switches got overheated, 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFR_Overspeed "Latched Error [1 = The configured speed limit (in the config) has been exceeded by motor 3, 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFR_Overcurrent "Latched Error [1 = An overcurrent in atleast one phase of inverter 3 was detected (more than 120A (175A for HV-Board_P1)), 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFR_Motortemperature "Latched Error [1 = Motor temperature measurement of inverter 3 did not work for more than 500 ms, 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFR_Internal_Fault "Latched Error [1 = Internal fault inverter 3, see Error.txt for more information (possible causes: measurement of phase currents, DC voltage, power switches temperature or gate driver supply (could also be triggered by insufficient supply)), 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFR_Disable_Under_Load "Latched Error [1 = The received enable signal of inverter 3 became low while motor was under load, 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFR_ControlError "Latched Error [1 = The current controllers of inverter 3 were unable to achieve the setpoint currents (the reference point calibration is probably incorrect or the set voltage reserve may be too low), 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFR_4_DC_Undervoltage "Latched Error [1 = DC-Voltage dropped below defined treshold (in config) while inverter 3 or 4 was in drive state, 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterFR_4_DC_Overvoltage "Latched Error [1 = A voltage exceeding 700V has occurred on the HV board of inverters 3&4, 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterRR_Timeout_Comm "Latched Error [1 = No new setpoint message for inverter 2 was received for more than 50 ms, 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterRR_Sum_Phase_Currents "Latched Error [1 = The sum of the phase currents of inverter 2 was greater than 20A (there may be an insulation fault in the motor, a measurement error due to very strong EMI, or a wiring problem for parallel inverter operation), 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterRR_Short_Circuit "Latched Error [1 =The desat (hardware overcurrent) protection of atleast one power switch of inverter 2 triggered (this could be due to a short circuit between two phases.), 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterRR_Position_Sensor "Latched Error [1 = No valid position data for inverter 2 was received for more than 350  s (The communication may be disturbed by noise, or the sensor itself or the interface board may be defective), 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterRR_Overtemperature "Latched Error [1 = Inverter 2 was deactivated because either the motor or the power switches got overheated, 0 = no error]";
CM_ SG_ 1025 Err_InverterRR_Overspeed "Latched Error [1 = The configured speed limit (in the config) has been exceeded by motor 2, 0 = no error]";
